<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lo, the Spirit is now working!</l><l>To convict of righteousness,</l><l>For which Christ hath resurrected;</l><l>All the nations thus to bless.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lo, the Spirit is now working!</l><l>Satan’s judgment to proclaim;</l><l>Thus releasing from his bondage</l><l>All who would not share his shame.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lo, the Spirit is now working!</l><l>To proclaim to every man</l><l>Sin, and righteousness, and judgment;</l><l>God’s economy and plan.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
